              <div class="surface__desc">
                <p>
                  A thread can work in a checkout of its own. Pick it, and the sidebar leads with what is
                  moving there: its uncommitted changes, its branch against main, then the files its
                  latest commits touched.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Edit a file and it saves a moment after you stop typing. It says when an agent is working
                  in its checkout, and your edit never overwrites newer changes saved there. Comment on a
                  line of a diff to send it to that agent's thread.
                </p>
                <p class="surface__note">
                  On your iPhone, the Repositories tab lists the same files, read only.
